WEBVTT

00:11.017 --> 00:13.186
‪GRADE 2 CLASS 2

00:14.021 --> 00:15.689
<i>‪Whoa… Whoa…</i>

00:15.772 --> 00:17.107
<i>‪What a turn of events!</i>

00:17.190 --> 00:18.400
‪IN SUSPENSE
‪BA-BUMP BA-BUMP

00:18.483 --> 00:21.361
<i>‪How on earth did they adapt</i>
<i>‪this narrative trick for the screen?</i>

00:22.195 --> 00:25.198
‪There's another movie based on a book
‪by the same author airing on TV this week.

00:25.282 --> 00:28.577
<i>‪I remember seeing that movie</i>
<i>‪when I was in middle school.</i>

00:29.494 --> 00:30.495
<i>‪With Igarashi.</i>

00:31.037 --> 00:32.831
<i>‪What a good movie.</i>

00:33.331 --> 00:36.293
‪I got lost, like,
‪halfway through that movie.

00:38.003 --> 00:41.715
<i>‪Wait… I may have found it entertaining,</i>

00:43.008 --> 00:44.968
<i>‪but what do other people think?</i>

00:45.969 --> 00:47.220
<i>‪Now what?</i>

00:47.304 --> 00:50.140
<i>‪I really want Amamiya</i>
<i>‪to read the original.</i>

00:50.223 --> 00:51.975
<i>‪Full of oneself.</i>

00:53.727 --> 00:54.728
‪POKE OUT

00:56.605 --> 00:57.606
‪Amamiya.

00:57.689 --> 01:00.233
‪You scared me. What is it?

01:00.901 --> 01:02.194
‪Well…

01:04.571 --> 01:06.656
‪That movie we were
‪talking about this morning…

01:06.740 --> 01:10.702
‪I have the book, so…

01:11.828 --> 01:14.664
‪Would you like to read it?

01:15.832 --> 01:17.167
‪MUTTER MUTTER
‪MUMBLE MUMBLE

01:17.250 --> 01:20.087
‪I mean, if you're gonna watch the movie,
‪then you'd know what it'll be about.

01:20.170 --> 01:22.380
‪But it's kind of thick,
‪so I won't force you to read it--

01:22.464 --> 01:24.508
‪I'll read it. I want to read it.

01:28.261 --> 01:29.554
‪Wow…

01:30.764 --> 01:32.641
‪You have no idea how happy I am.

01:36.937 --> 01:38.271
‪What?

01:38.355 --> 01:39.606
<i>‪Thank goodness!</i>

01:39.689 --> 01:41.691
‪RELIEVED
‪GLAD HE'S INTERESTED IN THE BOOK

01:41.775 --> 01:43.777
‪FLUFFY
‪GLAD SHE REMEMBERED THEIR CONVERSATION

01:44.361 --> 01:45.403
‪Thank you.

01:47.531 --> 01:50.367
<i>‪I didn't see him</i>
<i>‪as this sort of person at first.</i>

01:50.867 --> 01:52.369
<i>‪But now…</i>

01:54.621 --> 01:55.622
‪TEEHEE

01:55.705 --> 01:56.790
<i>‪He's cute.</i>

01:57.332 --> 01:58.542
‪What are you doing?

02:10.137 --> 02:11.763
‪STRETCH - SWISH

02:11.847 --> 02:15.559
<i>‪I really hyped that book up to him.</i>
<i>‪Hopefully he doesn't feel obligated.</i>

02:16.143 --> 02:17.894
‪I'll read it. I want to read it.

02:17.978 --> 02:21.398
‪You have no idea how happy I am.

02:38.874 --> 02:39.916
‪Morning.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.418
‪Morning.

02:42.002 --> 02:43.587
‪You're leaving already?

02:43.670 --> 02:46.006
‪Yeah. I'm preparing a meeting today.

02:47.007 --> 02:48.091
‪All right.

02:48.175 --> 02:50.719
‪There's money next to the whiteboard.

02:50.802 --> 02:51.887
‪Thanks.

02:51.970 --> 02:53.179
‪Make sure you lock up.

02:53.263 --> 02:54.431
‪See you.

02:55.015 --> 02:56.182
‪Take care.

03:03.273 --> 03:05.901
<i>‪Mom always leaves for work early.</i>

03:06.776 --> 03:07.944
‪MONEY FOR FOOD

03:08.028 --> 03:11.406
<i>‪And ever since the divorce,</i>
<i>‪she gets home later and later.</i>

03:13.033 --> 03:15.827
<i>‪I'm usually on my own at home.</i>

03:18.914 --> 03:21.207
‪Sometimes I wonder.

03:21.750 --> 03:23.919
‪Do I even exist?

03:24.628 --> 03:25.629
<i>‪Don't be silly.</i>

03:25.712 --> 03:27.923
<i>‪It can't be helped in my case.</i>

03:28.506 --> 03:29.674
<i>‪Yeah.</i>

03:32.761 --> 03:35.847
<i>‪This is just normal for me.</i>

05:07.564 --> 05:11.985
‪EPISODE 12
‪THUNDER

05:12.861 --> 05:15.363
‪Wow, really?

05:15.447 --> 05:18.116
‪How did you decide on your job?

05:18.199 --> 05:21.745
‪I can never find any good ones
‪in those free newspapers.

05:21.828 --> 05:23.121
‪Well…

05:23.204 --> 05:25.999
‪-I've even registered on an app.
‪-<i>‪So conversational.</i>

05:26.082 --> 05:28.335
<i>‪Why? Why now?</i>

05:29.210 --> 05:30.211
‪SQUEEZE SQUEEZE

05:30.295 --> 05:33.506
<i>‪No. Stop that. It's rude.</i>
<i>‪You're doing it again.</i>

05:33.590 --> 05:36.259
‪STARE

05:39.095 --> 05:40.764
‪SMILE

05:42.724 --> 05:44.225
<i>‪What an aesthetic face…</i>

05:45.602 --> 05:49.147
‪Koyun seems to be getting along well
‪with the first years out of nowhere.

05:49.731 --> 05:50.982
<i>‪How strange.</i>

05:51.066 --> 05:52.901
‪Yeah. When did that happen?

05:52.984 --> 05:54.152
<i>‪How strange.</i>

05:55.361 --> 05:57.405
‪And she's super pretty too!

05:57.489 --> 05:58.656
‪What is she?

06:01.659 --> 06:03.078
<i>‪Well, I didn't see that coming.</i>

06:03.745 --> 06:05.497
‪Okay! Break's over.

06:05.580 --> 06:07.248
‪First years! Could you come here, please?

06:07.332 --> 06:08.666
‪-Okay.
‪-Okay.

06:09.292 --> 06:12.337
‪The third years are calling.
‪I'd better go.

06:12.420 --> 06:13.421
‪Okay.

06:13.505 --> 06:16.674
‪WAVE WAVE

06:23.515 --> 06:25.683
‪TAP TAP TAP
‪THUMP THUMP - WHACK

06:25.767 --> 06:27.185
<i>‪So it's…</i>

06:33.733 --> 06:35.985
‪Stop that, Hayato…

06:42.408 --> 06:43.409
‪CLENCH

06:43.493 --> 06:44.494
‪Scared you, didn't I?

06:44.577 --> 06:46.329
‪THIS IS PAYBACK FOR THE OTHER DAY
‪SUPER SURPRISED

06:46.412 --> 06:47.455
‪Yeah…

06:47.539 --> 06:50.166
‪I lost Miki and Tsukiko.

06:50.250 --> 06:52.335
<i>‪She's just sitting down.</i>

06:56.422 --> 06:57.841
‪-Minato.
‪-'Aye!

06:58.633 --> 07:00.009
‪"'Aye"?

07:00.093 --> 07:02.095
‪So, this Sunday's tournament,

07:02.178 --> 07:05.098
‪we're short on controllers,
‪so can you bring yours from home?

07:05.181 --> 07:06.808
‪-Yeah, sure.
‪-<i>‪Video games?</i>

07:06.891 --> 07:08.810
‪-How many are coming?
‪-Three.

07:08.893 --> 07:12.313
‪Can you imagine if we had a racing wheel?
‪That'd be the best.

07:12.397 --> 07:14.023
‪Go and buy one, Hayato.

07:14.107 --> 07:15.442
‪I'm paying for it now?

07:17.735 --> 07:19.112
‪FWUMP

07:19.195 --> 07:20.488
‪DEJA VU

07:20.572 --> 07:23.908
‪Come on. I'm clearly in the way here.

07:24.409 --> 07:26.494
‪Sorry about that.

07:27.245 --> 07:30.290
‪I don't care if you're not needed here,
‪or if you think you're in the way.

07:33.209 --> 07:35.587
‪I just want you here with me.

07:38.339 --> 07:39.841
‪I mean, that's it, really…

07:40.925 --> 07:41.926
‪I…

07:49.684 --> 07:50.768
‪What now…

07:50.852 --> 07:51.853
‪SWOOSH

07:51.936 --> 07:55.231
‪The blond one is Daichi Midorikawa.
‪And the other one is in another class.

07:55.315 --> 07:56.316
‪Introduce me properly!

07:56.399 --> 07:57.400
‪HAHAHA

07:57.484 --> 08:00.904
‪It's Haya-to Aka-hoshi!

08:00.987 --> 08:02.280
‪I know, I know.

08:02.363 --> 08:05.783
‪That's "Aka" from "Akahoshi."
‪"Hoshi" from "Akahoshi." It's "Akahoshi"!

08:05.867 --> 08:07.494
‪You need to calm down.

08:08.995 --> 08:11.414
‪201 - HIKAWA
‪401 - AZUMI

08:11.498 --> 08:12.707
‪MIKI'S HOUSE

08:12.790 --> 08:15.710
‪You're really not coming riding
‪with us tomorrow, Koyun?

08:15.793 --> 08:18.505
‪I'm fine.
‪Plus, I've got work in the evening.

08:18.588 --> 08:19.672
‪I see.

08:20.298 --> 08:22.759
<i>‪Let's be real here.</i>
<i>‪I'd definitely be a third wheel.</i>

08:23.760 --> 08:26.679
<i>‪They'd be so cute together!</i>
<i>‪I wish I could see it!</i>

08:27.263 --> 08:28.890
‪TCH…

08:34.395 --> 08:36.940
‪Yota's pretty cool, isn't he?

08:38.358 --> 08:39.943
<i>‪What?</i>

08:40.026 --> 08:42.237
‪He's dependable, and he's always so calm.

08:42.320 --> 08:43.530
‪IT'S THAT WAY

08:43.613 --> 08:44.864
<i>‪Is he?</i>

08:44.948 --> 08:45.949
‪THUNK

08:46.032 --> 08:52.247
‪I really wish I could be
‪as warm and kind as he is.

08:52.330 --> 08:55.250
<i>‪What? So what you're saying is…</i>

08:56.084 --> 08:58.962
‪Koyun. Are Yota and Minato…
‪"different" for you?

08:59.796 --> 09:01.798
‪What? What do you mean by "different"?

09:01.881 --> 09:03.508
<i>‪Why's she bringing up Amamiya?</i>

09:04.092 --> 09:07.262
‪I mean, yeah, of course.
‪They're two different people, so…

09:07.971 --> 09:09.931
‪But that's not what you meant?

09:10.473 --> 09:13.017
<i>‪What's this?</i>
<i>‪She's getting super flustered.</i>

09:14.394 --> 09:18.064
‪I still get kind of nervous
‪when I'm around Amamiya.

09:18.147 --> 09:20.024
‪Sometimes.

09:20.692 --> 09:23.278
<i>‪So she's not nervous around Yota?</i>

09:23.361 --> 09:24.362
‪MUTTER MUTTER

09:24.445 --> 09:28.157
‪I still don't know Amamiya
‪as well as I know Yota, so…

09:28.241 --> 09:32.620
‪But, like, I would like
‪to get to know him better, so…

09:33.162 --> 09:38.334
<i>‪She prides herself on knowing Yota well!</i>

09:46.676 --> 09:48.970
‪Dam!

09:51.180 --> 09:52.932
‪This is so cool!

09:53.933 --> 09:54.934
‪It is pretty neat.

09:55.018 --> 09:58.313
‪It's so neat! My heart's skipping beats!

09:59.939 --> 10:02.358
‪Here, Yota. Get in the photo.

10:06.070 --> 10:08.114
‪Wait, how to fix this?

10:08.197 --> 10:10.325
‪I can't get any of the background.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.410
‪CAN'T THINK OF THE WORD "ARM"

10:12.493 --> 10:15.204
‪You take it, Yota. With your "long limbs."

10:15.288 --> 10:16.623
‪"Long limbs"?

10:17.290 --> 10:18.291
‪Like this?

10:18.374 --> 10:20.376
‪Yeah, just like that! Yay!

10:30.720 --> 10:31.888
‪HAHA

10:47.570 --> 10:49.906
‪That was so much fun.

10:50.490 --> 10:51.491
‪It was.

10:52.158 --> 10:53.159
‪Yota.

10:53.743 --> 10:55.244
‪Where to next?

10:56.621 --> 11:00.041
‪You said you wanted to visit
‪a valley before, right?

11:00.124 --> 11:02.126
‪Shall we go in the summer?

11:06.005 --> 11:08.383
‪We… We could do
‪an abandoned railway track?

11:08.466 --> 11:09.467
‪PLONK

11:09.550 --> 11:10.760
‪Sounds rad!

11:11.761 --> 11:12.762
‪-B!
‪-WB!

11:12.845 --> 11:14.180
‪TRANSLATION: I'M BACK
‪TRANSLATION: WELCOME BACK

11:14.847 --> 11:17.100
‪-How was your date?
‪-Date? You're too funny.

11:17.183 --> 11:18.184
‪AB ROLLER

11:18.267 --> 11:21.020
‪It's not like that with Yota.

11:21.104 --> 11:23.106
‪It's not "man and woman" between us.

11:23.189 --> 11:25.983
‪Man, today was so much fun!

11:26.067 --> 11:27.193
‪Good for you.

11:27.276 --> 11:31.781
‪I mean, yeah, I'd like to have
‪some romance eventually, but…

11:31.864 --> 11:33.366
‪But Yota's different.

11:33.449 --> 11:36.202
‪We're not like that.
‪I could never date him.

11:36.786 --> 11:37.870
‪Really?

11:37.954 --> 11:38.955
‪Yep!

11:39.038 --> 11:42.458
‪Besides, friends come first!

11:44.085 --> 11:45.128
‪You are so right.

11:45.211 --> 11:46.212
‪You see?

11:46.796 --> 11:48.381
<i>‪-Major mood!</i>
<i>‪-Major mood!</i>

11:48.464 --> 11:51.509
<i>‪-Bros before hoes! Chicks before dicks!</i>
<i>‪-Bros before hoes! Chicks before dicks!</i>

11:51.592 --> 11:53.136
<i>‪You got it, my bro!</i>

11:53.219 --> 11:54.804
<i>‪-Damn straight!</i>
<i>‪-Damn straight!</i>

11:54.887 --> 11:56.347
<i>‪-Darn tootin'!</i>
<i>‪-Darn tootin'!</i>

11:56.431 --> 11:57.723
<i>‪-Preach it!</i>
<i>‪-Preach it!</i>

12:09.902 --> 12:13.698
<i>‪Hey, did you get your freebie tickets for</i>
<i>‪that crepe store near the train station?</i>

12:13.781 --> 12:15.491
‪Freebie tickets?

12:15.575 --> 12:17.702
<i>‪Here. I'll send you the URL.</i>

12:17.785 --> 12:20.037
<i>‪You get up to two per person.</i>
<i>‪Make sure you get them.</i>

12:20.121 --> 12:21.372
‪Thanks.

12:25.585 --> 12:29.005
‪MARU: URL FOR THE CREPES

12:34.427 --> 12:38.264
‪You're not gonna take a photo?

12:40.349 --> 12:42.727
‪Right. I guess it is pretty unique.

12:42.810 --> 12:43.811
‪BETTER TAKE A PICTURE

12:43.895 --> 12:45.396
‪It looks unique?

12:46.105 --> 12:48.024
<i>‪I don't know what's come over me.</i>

12:49.233 --> 12:52.570
<i>‪Somehow, Momoka roped me</i>
<i>‪into a little detour on the way home.</i>

12:53.070 --> 12:56.199
‪I'll send you the pic,
‪so can you give me your details?

12:57.158 --> 12:58.242
‪Okay.

12:59.076 --> 13:02.955
‪Koyun. I've got tickets for two free
‪crepes. Want to have my second crepe?

13:03.039 --> 13:04.624
‪Sure.

13:05.458 --> 13:07.543
<i>‪Are you sure you want me?</i>

13:08.085 --> 13:13.925
‪Say, Koyun. You're good friends with guys.
‪How can I be better friends with guys too?

13:14.008 --> 13:15.092
‪What?

13:15.635 --> 13:17.512
<i>‪You're asking me?</i>

13:17.595 --> 13:22.517
‪I really think you're much better
‪at socializing than I am, Momoka.

13:23.100 --> 13:25.144
‪That may be so.

13:25.228 --> 13:26.979
<i>‪She doesn't deny it?</i>

13:27.063 --> 13:31.776
‪But I've never really had
‪a proper friendship with a guy before.

13:32.777 --> 13:35.196
‪I think you'd be popular with the guys.

13:35.279 --> 13:36.447
‪I am.

13:38.616 --> 13:40.952
‪Are you thinking, "She doesn't deny it"?

13:41.035 --> 13:42.036
‪EEK

13:43.704 --> 13:45.706
‪You're so cute, Koyun.

13:46.207 --> 13:49.794
<i>‪I don't think her "cute"</i>
<i>‪is meant to be a compliment.</i>

13:50.378 --> 13:54.799
‪Though, I guess you could be
‪good friends with someone,

13:54.882 --> 13:57.218
‪but then all of a sudden
‪you've caught feels.

13:57.301 --> 13:59.053
‪Has that ever happened with you?

13:59.136 --> 14:00.137
‪What?

14:01.264 --> 14:03.558
‪I don't think so.

14:04.141 --> 14:07.144
‪Really? So you keep everything separate?

14:07.228 --> 14:10.314
<i>‪Why did that stop my thoughts</i>
<i>‪in their tracks for a second?</i>

14:12.400 --> 14:14.402
‪I don't think I could do it.

14:15.403 --> 14:20.116
‪I'd definitely fall in love with Amamiya.

14:21.325 --> 14:25.997
‪A guy as good-looking as him near me?
‪I'd definitely end up head over heels.

14:27.039 --> 14:28.374
<i>‪Good-looking?</i>

14:29.125 --> 14:30.668
‪You think so?

14:32.003 --> 14:35.506
<i>‪I'm very free with my compliments</i>
<i>‪when it comes to Yota…</i>

14:38.342 --> 14:40.803
<i>‪So why do I struggle for words</i>
<i>‪when it comes to Amamiya?</i>

14:41.637 --> 14:43.556
‪GRADE 2 CLASS 2

14:43.639 --> 14:46.058
‪Koyun. Thanks for the book.

14:46.726 --> 14:48.394
‪You finished already?

14:48.477 --> 14:50.855
‪Yeah. I couldn't put it down.

14:50.938 --> 14:53.065
‪And I couldn't wait
‪to talk with you about it.

14:53.733 --> 14:55.443
‪Yeah? I'm glad to hear it.

14:58.154 --> 15:01.198
<i>‪Amamiya… Your feels are showing.</i>

15:01.282 --> 15:03.284
<i>‪Please keep your feels in check.</i>

15:03.951 --> 15:07.872
‪That mood shift in the final chapter
‪really gave me the chills.

15:07.955 --> 15:09.415
‪Me too. I really lik--

15:13.544 --> 15:14.921
‪WHOA

15:15.755 --> 15:20.509
‪A guy as good-looking as him near me?
‪I'd definitely end up head over heels.

15:20.593 --> 15:23.512
<i>‪No, it's not that he's good-looking.</i>

15:23.596 --> 15:25.514
<i>‪It's the things he says.</i>

15:25.598 --> 15:27.475
<i>‪It's the way he acts, and his face.</i>

15:27.558 --> 15:28.893
<i>‪He makes me happy.</i>

15:28.976 --> 15:31.395
<i>‪He gives me butterflies…</i>

15:32.021 --> 15:33.522
<i>‪What's this?</i>

15:34.941 --> 15:36.025
<i>‪What happened?</i>

15:37.401 --> 15:39.862
<i>‪She won't look me in the eye today.</i>

15:40.988 --> 15:43.950
<i>‪Koyuki seems pretty put off.</i>

15:44.450 --> 15:45.660
<i>‪Is she okay?</i>

15:46.243 --> 15:47.578
‪What book is that?

15:47.662 --> 15:48.663
‪BA-BUMP

15:49.288 --> 15:52.667
‪I'd lent it to Amamiya,
‪and he was just giving it back to me.

15:52.750 --> 15:53.918
‪Wanna read it too?

15:54.001 --> 15:55.002
‪SHOCK

15:55.086 --> 15:56.170
<i>‪What?</i>

15:56.963 --> 15:58.547
‪I read it in just two days.

15:59.423 --> 16:01.342
‪It's not a competition, man.

16:09.725 --> 16:10.810
‪What?

16:10.893 --> 16:11.894
‪FIDGET FIDGET

16:11.978 --> 16:16.023
<i>‪Could this be a one-sided thing</i>
<i>‪from Amamiya's side?</i>

16:16.107 --> 16:19.151
‪We use "is not" instead of "does not"
‪in a negative sentence

16:19.235 --> 16:21.070
‪because the subject
‪is third-person singular…

16:21.153 --> 16:23.572
<i>‪What is this feeling?</i>

16:24.281 --> 16:29.829
<i>‪Come on. I'm not so dense</i>
<i>‪as to not know what it really is.</i>

16:30.538 --> 16:33.332
‪What do I do?

16:34.250 --> 16:37.545
<i>‪I've noticed a change in my feelings.</i>

16:38.754 --> 16:39.755
<i>‪But…</i>

16:39.839 --> 16:40.840
‪Koyun! Good morning.

16:40.923 --> 16:42.174
‪WHOOSH

16:42.258 --> 16:43.843
<i>‪In saying that,</i>

16:45.177 --> 16:46.929
<i>‪I don't act on it.</i>

16:48.681 --> 16:50.599
<i>‪I haven't actually changed.</i>

16:56.105 --> 16:58.107
<i>‪I'm just living my life as normal.</i>

17:01.819 --> 17:05.614
<i>‪But this giddy, butterfly kind of state</i>

17:06.949 --> 17:08.409
<i>‪is kind of fun.</i>

17:10.119 --> 17:11.662
‪Then I'll see you tomorrow.

17:11.746 --> 17:13.122
‪-See you!
‪-See you!

17:14.582 --> 17:15.583
‪APPEARS

17:15.666 --> 17:17.668
‪Wait, Koyun.
‪You're not coming to evening practice?

17:17.752 --> 17:19.128
<i>‪He's doing it!</i>

17:19.795 --> 17:24.467
‪No. Most people just tend to talk
‪during the evening practice.

17:24.550 --> 17:27.344
‪I doubt I'd bother anyone
‪if I didn't show up.

17:27.428 --> 17:29.388
‪Okay…

17:29.472 --> 17:31.891
<i>‪Koyuki.</i>
<i>‪That's what evening practice is for.</i>

17:31.974 --> 17:33.851
‪CHEER COUPLES TEND TO EMERGE
‪AFTER THE SPORTS FESTIVAL

17:33.934 --> 17:36.896
<i>‪You could even say it's specific time</i>
<i>‪set aside for people to mingle.</i>

17:36.979 --> 17:39.690
‪-<i>‪This is all implied knowledge.</i>
‪-I've already memorized the moves.

17:39.774 --> 17:42.902
‪-<i>‪This is an overt invitation for you!</i>
‪-Don't worry. I won't let the team down.

17:43.569 --> 17:44.570
‪See you.

17:47.740 --> 17:49.909
<i>‪Keep your chin up, Amamiya.</i>

17:50.493 --> 17:52.411
‪EVENING PRACTICE

17:52.495 --> 17:54.663
‪HERE FOR SOLO PRACTICE

17:54.747 --> 17:56.916
‪HERE TO MINGLE

17:58.375 --> 18:01.087
<i>‪Did I blunder something again?</i>

18:02.671 --> 18:04.090
‪Amamiya!

18:05.382 --> 18:08.594
‪Thank goodness. I'm so relieved.

18:08.677 --> 18:09.678
‪You're relieved?

18:09.762 --> 18:13.682
‪I kind of missed my chance
‪to join a group because I came late.

18:14.350 --> 18:16.560
‪Could we hang out for a bit?

18:20.439 --> 18:24.276
‪Seems like there's cliques popping up
‪all over the place now, huh?

18:24.360 --> 18:26.529
‪Yeah, it happens.

18:27.530 --> 18:30.825
‪It's a shame I won't get the chance
‪to mingle with the seniors

18:30.908 --> 18:32.952
‪once the sports festival is over.

18:33.035 --> 18:35.663
‪You can still speak to us
‪even after the festival?

18:40.209 --> 18:43.838
‪Right! I hung out with Koyun
‪the other day. Just the two of us.

18:43.921 --> 18:44.922
‪You did?

18:45.005 --> 18:46.590
<i>‪When did these two get so close?</i>

18:46.674 --> 18:47.675
‪SLIGHTLY BITTER

18:48.509 --> 18:50.678
‪We had crepes.

18:50.761 --> 18:52.805
‪I've got a few of these.

18:52.888 --> 18:54.181
‪HEH

18:56.642 --> 18:59.937
‪Koyun looks so stiff.

19:02.523 --> 19:06.485
‪Shall I invite you as well
‪the next time Koyun and I hang out?

19:06.569 --> 19:08.445
‪Are you sure you want me there?

19:08.529 --> 19:09.864
‪Of course!

19:09.947 --> 19:12.449
‪I'll make sure to invite you,
‪so please give me your details.

19:12.533 --> 19:13.826
‪Sure.

19:16.620 --> 19:19.456
‪The seniors all get along so well, huh?

19:20.166 --> 19:22.418
‪Koyun's always talking about you guys.

19:22.501 --> 19:25.963
‪About Miki, about Yota…

19:27.423 --> 19:28.465
<i>‪What about me?</i>

19:28.549 --> 19:33.470
‪I'm so jealous of the relationship
‪Koyun and Yota seem to have.

19:34.346 --> 19:35.723
<i>‪What sort of relationship is that?</i>

19:35.806 --> 19:39.602
‪Don't you think those two
‪should just go out already?

19:39.685 --> 19:41.228
‪DOOM

19:41.312 --> 19:42.396
‪SEETHING

19:42.479 --> 19:44.064
‪What makes you say that?

19:44.148 --> 19:46.483
‪Because! Don't they look so good together?

19:47.276 --> 19:51.614
‪Well, we don't know how either of them
‪really feels about each other.

19:52.114 --> 19:54.783
<i>‪Yota probably still likes Miki.</i>

19:54.867 --> 19:57.119
<i>‪And I don't know about Hikawa.</i>

19:57.703 --> 19:59.371
‪Yeah, you're right.

19:59.455 --> 20:02.208
‪-I'm sorry. That was rude of me.
‪-No, not at all.

20:02.291 --> 20:03.626
‪WASN'T TRYING TO REPRIMAND

20:04.210 --> 20:05.252
‪And you're right.

20:05.336 --> 20:07.630
‪Imagine finding out someone
‪who you thought was a friend

20:07.713 --> 20:11.133
‪actually liked you as something more?

20:11.842 --> 20:14.136
‪To think they see you differently…

20:14.720 --> 20:16.889
‪I'd feel a bit disgusted.
‪Wouldn't you agree?

20:16.972 --> 20:18.140
‪CRACK

20:18.224 --> 20:21.644
‪It could even be kind of scary,
‪depending on the situation.

20:23.729 --> 20:25.648
‪-But what's more…
‪-<i>‪There's more?</i>

20:26.232 --> 20:32.404
‪Koyun did say she'd never see her friends
‪as potential love interests.

20:33.155 --> 20:34.156
<i>‪What?</i>

20:40.496 --> 20:41.622
‪You disgust me.

20:48.420 --> 20:51.215
<i>‪Did I cross a line?</i>

22:26.935 --> 22:28.228
‪We made it!

22:37.946 --> 22:39.865
<i>‪Yikes, this is awkward.</i>

22:39.948 --> 22:41.950
<i>‪I know she's on the cheer squad,</i>

22:42.034 --> 22:45.871
<i>‪but it's still super awkward</i>
<i>‪having to deal</i>

22:45.954 --> 22:47.790
<i>‪with the sister of someone</i>
<i>‪I got in a huge fight with.</i>

22:48.499 --> 22:50.459
‪Atagawa. How's your sister?

22:52.127 --> 22:53.712
‪Don't make that face.

22:53.796 --> 22:56.090
‪Aren't you curious
‪about your former classmate?

22:56.632 --> 22:58.175
‪Not really…

23:00.677 --> 23:02.304
‪You really want to know?

23:02.387 --> 23:03.388
‪EEK

23:05.140 --> 23:06.266
‪Wow, it's packed.

23:10.395 --> 23:12.106
‪Sorry about this.

23:12.189 --> 23:15.943
‪No. I'm sorry. For hogging the wall.

23:18.612 --> 23:19.696
‪Koyuki.

23:21.406 --> 23:23.742
‪You're friends with Amamiya, right?

23:24.368 --> 23:27.287
<i>‪What does she mean by that?</i>

23:27.371 --> 23:30.332
‪Yeah, we're friends.

23:31.208 --> 23:35.587
‪The soccer club doesn't allow dating
‪between members and managers.

23:37.881 --> 23:42.302
‪Momoka's been hanging out with you
‪a lot recently, hasn't she?

23:42.970 --> 23:45.305
‪When she used to hang out with me.

23:46.098 --> 23:48.267
‪You do know why, right?

23:50.853 --> 23:54.314
‪Will you please root for her?
